    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realm Rift: The Hunt Across Worlds is an action-packed adventure where you, an Interstellar Marine, must race against time and an AI-driven enemy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set aboard a space station, you must teleport across three distinct worlds, each filled with danger and mystery, to collect powerful Gems before the AI's deadly clones get their hands on them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These Gems are the key to stopping the AI from creating Dyson spheres, which could mean the end of all life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle through hostile environments, face relentless enemies, and outsmart the AI's perfected clones as you fight to save humanity in a race across worlds.</p>",
